---
/* spring-fest.html — section 1 of 10.

   New for Spring Fest 2027, not carried across from the Co-work
   original: there was no third departure when the site was migrated.
   It follows hallucia/Hero.astro hook for hook — same classes, same
   data-parallax on the hero image, same chip row — so the shared motion
   and the page-wipe treat it exactly like the other two trip pages.

   Both hero frames are the two photographs Spring Fest sent that carry
   no watermark, which is why they are here rather than in the frames
   below. Their mark sits top-left, exactly where our own wordmark sits
   over a full-bleed hero; in a frame it reads as the credit it is, over
   the hero it would have read as two logos fighting. */
